From 153dae3b727f6bfd9844bb68834410f9f5d80e62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:59:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Far LODs built at load: merged block meshes beyond 70 m, cars
 beyond 90 m

A third of the street view's triangles were static block geometry and far
cars at distances where a triangle is well under a pixel.

Blocks (src/nyc/chunkLod.ts): bake() merges a block's static parts into a
few meshes per material (~100-140k triangles per block), drawn whole
whenever any of the block is in view. Each merged mesh over 400 triangles
gets a coarse twin: same material, attributes and bounds, simplified with
the vendored meshoptimizer (meshlod-core) within 6 cm, normals, uv seams
and colour borders weighed in, compacted (about a third of the triangles).
Blocks whose nearest point is beyond 70 m (back inside 62 m) show the
twins. NycLevel.update builds them the first time a block is that far, in
frames where no block is being built, in steps of ~1500 triangles (a
merged mesh is cut where its parts share no vertex): ~0.3 s per block,
longest step ~15 ms. Parts thinner than 6 cm (a door sill, a thin rod)
collapse to nothing in the twin.

Cars (vehicleFleet.ts): a fourth representation beyond FLEET_LOD.FAR =
90 m (back at 82 m): the far LOD of each model welded by position and
colour and simplified within 7 cm (2032 -> 421, 1754 -> 867, 2812 -> 631,
1626 -> 281 triangles ...), same materials, drawn by two more instance
batches per model. Built once per model when the simplifier's wasm is in;
until then, and for the halves it gains nothing on, the far LOD.

Node run of the street view through FastRenderer (fastrender's
js/test/world-objects.node.mjs --mesh-census): triangles sent 5.07 M ->
3.92 M per frame, with only the instances in view 2.25 M -> 1.75 M; merged
block meshes 973k -> 642k, far cars 276k -> 136k; shadow casters per pass
0.96 M -> 0.76 M; draws 1470 -> 1485.

tests/chunk-lod.test.ts: twins exist and are under 45 % of the triangles,
never stick out of the original by more than the error, keep material /
attributes / bounds / shadow flags, one version shown per level,
hysteresis. npm run qa: 264 passed.
